logs
# The image builds its own frontend bundle. A stale host dist/ left over from an
# earlier `npm run build` otherwise gets copied into the build context, and when
# the builder layer is a cache hit the app ships that old bundle silently — a
# `docker compose build` then "succeeds" while serving days-old UI.
apps/frontend/dist
